        "text": "**Considering Gingee Integration**\n\nI\u0027m now diving into the user request, focusing on how Gingee can accommodate SPAs while upholding its \"Instant Time to Joy\" philosophy. Client-side routing in SPAs means I need to create a server \"fallback\" mechanism to serve the main `index.html`. I\u0027m also exploring where the SPA source code and built assets should reside within the current `web/app_name/` structure. My next step involves defining the configuration options to make this seamless for developers.\n\n\n",
