        "text": "**Developing The Developer Flow**\n\nI\u0027m now focusing on how developers will use SPA support. I\u0027m building a workflow, considering: initial setup via `gingee-cli`, app configuration in `app.json` (including the `type: \"SPA\"` directive), the development server proxy setup to link the frontend (React, for this example) with the Gingee backend, and production deployment. Clear instructions and code examples are essential.\n\n\n",
