        "text": "**Designing the SPA Workflow**\n\nI\u0027m structuring the proposal as a developer guide, focusing on a clear, step-by-step workflow. I\u0027m focusing on scaffolding, configuration, the development experience (proxying), and production deployment. This includes modifications to the CLI and app.json, with emphasis on the new \u0027spa\u0027 block properties. I\u0027m aiming for minimal configuration, clear code samples, and a streamlined dev process.\n\n\n",
