        "text": "**Developing Core Functionality**\n\nI\u0027m now detailing the implementation specifics. Key challenges are surfacing: integrating with the CLI for an intuitive setup, defining the properties for the `spa` block in `app.json`, setting up the proxy for the development workflow, and the production build path. I\u0027m exploring Vite as the default bundler and working on code examples. I\u0027m focusing on simplicity, clear documentation, and efficient deployment.\n\n\n",
