        "text": "**Framing the Vue.js Proposal**\n\nI\u0027m currently deconstructing the recent React proposal to see how to tailor it for a Vue.js Single-Page Application. I\u0027m focusing on highlighting the key differences in setup and implementation between the two frameworks.\n\n\n",
