      "text": "I am rethinking on having the gingee-cli modifications, I think we should not bother with it, we can rather have the dev setup covered in documentation. Otherwise we would have to deal with all the permutations and combinations of the SPA frameworks. I think this because when I see your scaffolding it seems to be specific to this use case of an spa with react-vite-tailwind combination",
