      "text": "**Planning Gindoo\u0027s Development**\n\nI\u0027m ready to move into Phase 2!  I\u0027ll start by acknowledging the shift. Next, I\u0027ll leverage that new CLI command to generate the Gindoo app\u0027s scaffolding. The journey ahead is clear now, with concrete steps.\n\n\n**Mapping Gindoo\u0027s Architecture**\n\nMy focus has shifted to Phase 2, ready to lay the foundation for Gindoo\u0027s backend. The steps are now: acknowledging the new phase, employing the updated CLI to scaffold the application\u0027s structure, and defining the database schema for Users and Tasks. We\u0027ll then craft a startup script to create the tables, configure app.json, and design the routes.json for the API. As a critical starting point, I will implement the GET /tasks endpoint.\n\n\n**Building Gindoo\u0027s Backend**\n\nI\u0027m now diving into the core of Gindoo\u0027s backend. The focus is to outline the process meticulously. First, Phase 2 is declared. Then, I\u0027ll leverage the new CLI command to generate the foundational backend structure.  Next, I\u0027ll thoroughly define the database schema for both Users and Tasks. We\u0027ll then craft a setup script, configure the app.json, design the routes, and implement the GET /tasks endpoint to kick things off.\n\n\n",
