      "text": "**Beginning Frontend Initialization**\n\nI\u0027ve acknowledged the backend\u0027s readiness and will now describe the frontend initialization process. This is based on the revised, framework-agnostic CLI workflow. My next step involves navigating to the project directory.\n\n\n**Describing React Initialization**\n\nI\u0027m now detailing the frontend initialization, starting with `cd`-ing into the `web/gindoo` directory and using `npm create vite@latest`. I plan to then demonstrate the commands for React with Vite and dependency installation. I will verify that the existing `app.json` configuration aligns with Vite defaults, eliminating any necessary modifications. Finally, I\u0027ll install Tailwind CSS and provide initial code for the entry points.\n\n\n",
