      "text": "**Integrating Components**\n\nI\u0027m currently focused on integrating key components. I\u0027ve built the `UserAvatar` for display consistency and the `UserFilter` dropdown. Next, I\u0027m integrating these into the user interface, aiming for a streamlined and efficient user experience.  The dashboard view is in progress, with the modal integration for task management up next.\n\n\n**Initiating Filtering Logic**\n\nI\u0027m now starting to integrate the user filter and updating data context to ensure appropriate filtering. After finishing the user filter component and integrating it with `KanbanPage.tsx`, I\u0027ll delve into the necessary updates for the data context and the API. Next, the task creation and editing modal, along with dashboard view, will be implemented.\n\n\n",
