        "text": "**Developing Backend \u0026 UI Plans**\n\nI\u0027m now deep-diving into the concrete steps for the backend and frontend. I\u0027m focusing on the `app.json` structure for the default admin and how the startup script will handle the initial user creation. The plan also covers the API security implementation, emphasizing admin role checks for endpoint access. I\u0027m carefully analyzing the UI component designs to ensure accurate visual alignment with the new designs.\n\n\n",
