        "text": "**Generating App.tsx**\n\nI\u0027m now fully immersed in the creation of the complete `App.tsx` file. I\u0027m meticulously incorporating all necessary imports, including `react-router-dom`, page components like `LoginPage`, `KanbanPage`, and context providers such as `AuthProvider` and `DataProvider`. My focus is on the `ProtectedRoute` component to handle authentication seamlessly. I\u0027ve designed the routing structure to handle the `/login` route publicly and secure the remaining routes with authentication, all within a `BrowserRouter` context with the correct `basename`.\n\n\n",
