      "text": "Yes works now but two modifications required\n\n1. In KanbanPage.tsx the calculation calc(100vh - 170px) has hard coded 170px, this should rather be based on actual calculations based on the screen resolution\n\n2. The scrolling behavior should not apply for mobile, in mobile the column should just grow with content",
