      "text": "Good click works now, but on trying to change the status and pressing submit, I get this script error and red error box on the modal\n\nDataContext.tsx:142 Failed to update task: Error: Unauthorized.\n    at updateTask (DataContext.tsx:137:23)\n    at async handleSave (TaskModal.tsx:58:17)\n\nDataContext.tsx:130 \n PUT http://localhost:7070/gindoo/api/tasks/244eba21-fe18-48c6-90ec-c8a4b92d48e6 401 (Unauthorized)",
