      "text": "All good, next lets fix the dashboard, see attached image, it seems to have the following problems\n\n1. It is still dark themed, it should switch to our current style\n2. It has its own header with logout button\n3. It has only one chart, it should have the following charts, tasks by status pie chart, assignee by task count bar graph (ignore user filter), assignee leader board based on tasks completed. All charts should use pastel colors\n4. The user filter too should be according to our current style\n\n",
