        "text": "**Verifying the Code Update**\n\nI\u0027ve examined the `gingee.js` changes, and confirmed that the `isDevelopment` flag is now derived from each app\u0027s `app.json` configuration, overriding the global setting. This granular control allows for individual app behavior in dev and production modes. I\u0027ve noted the default `\"mode\": \"production\"` and the merging of app configurations, and how this affects the dev server and request handler logic. The use of per-app flags simplifies environment management.\n\n\n",
