        "text": "**Grasping Per-App Settings**\n\nI\u0027ve examined the updated `gingee.js` file and confirmed the move of the `isDevelopment` flag to `app.json` on a per-app basis.  The new `mode` property in `defaultAppConfig` and the subsequent merging with `userAppConfig` allow per-app control over development/production mode, allowing mixed-mode configurations in the same Gingee instance, enhancing flexibility. The `initializeApps` and `requestHandler` functions now use an app-specific `isDevelopment` flag, simplifying environment management. I\u0027m ready for the next iteration.\n\n\n",
