      "text": "I want to create a Bootstrap 5 based landing page for the official GStore. This landing page should read a file gstore.json (see gstore-hosting-guide.md). It should display the lsit of apps, description and other meta information in a well organized manner similar to google play store. Ask me if you have any doubts before implmentation",
