      "text": "One change, the start and stop server, let us not keep it in the platform module as then we will expose it to privileged apps which consume the platform module. Rather lets have a new module modules/gdev.js which will have these functions this module will then be used by both the server and the platform module. Do you agree? crtically evaluate it and state your finding",
